# Line endings: LF in the repo and in every checkout, whatever core.autocrlf says on the machine.
# Why: build scripts read files raw (site/scripts/docs-build.mjs strips the first "# " line with a
# newline-anchored regex); on 2026-09-04 a CRLF checkout of docs/*.md shipped /docs/ pages with two <h1>s.
* text=auto eol=lf
